# Phone / PWA

**Chat name:** `Phone`  
**Sidebar label:** n/a  
**Agent starter:** `.cursor/agents/phone.md`

## Phone bottom bar

Phone only (`md:hidden`). Desktop/iPad keep the sidebar.

| Slot | Tabs |
|------|------|
| Bottom bar | Pipeline · Calendar · Tasks · Tools · Profile |
| Swipe up (More) | Documents |

Logo in the header goes Home. No Home tab. Profile opens `settings`. On Home, no tab is selected.

Phone header has no avatar menu. Install app and Sign out live at the bottom of Profile settings.

Handle on the tab bar opens the More sheet (same as swipe up). Swipe down or tap the dimmer to close.

Phone edge swipe (48px inset): swipe right from the left edge = Back (same stack as in-app Back). Swipe left from the right edge = Forward, only to undo the last Back — not for switching tabs. Pipeline cards leave those edge strips alone.

`phoneTabBar` / `phoneTabSheet` in `app/page.tsx` (`renderPhoneTabBar`).

